1	// Page 2 inside the scan volume: what the AI made of the raw evidence at the current checkpoint.
2	// Comment points have already flown into their clusters (the morph in Scene). This layer adds the structure on top:
3	// cluster nodes (blue = something to improve, white = something to keep; mark shape = track state: dot held,
